    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_6",
      "type": "bridge",
      "performer": "Nate Ruess, Eminem",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "I want a new life (Start over)",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "One without a cause (Clean slate)",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "So I'm coming home tonight (Yeah)",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Well, no matter what the cost",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "And if the plane goes down",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "Or if the crew can't wake me up",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "Well, just know that I'm alright",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "I was not afraid to die",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "Oh, even if there's songs to sing",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "Well, my children will carry me",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "Just know that I'm alright",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "I was not afraid to die",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "Because I put my faith in my little girls",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "13",
          "text": "So I'll never say goodbye cruel world",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "14",
          "text": "Just know that I'm alright",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "15",
          "text": "I am not afraid to die",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
